     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Next week, Nistara Randhawa will give a talk on authoring and documenting packages. It should be great:</p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:1.2em 0px;border-left-width:4px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(221,221,221);padding:0px 1em;color:rgb(119,119,119);quotes:none\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Learn how to write and document your own packages using devtools and github. You’ll need git and rstudio installed on your laptops (the prerequisites listed on <a href=\"http://stat545.com/git07_git-github-rstudio.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stat545.com/git07_git-github-rstudio.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317988000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QIpe4m0DuCLhKk6QrgZXf\">http://stat545.com/git07_git-github-rstudio.html</a> are useful for this), as well as the ‘devtools’ library.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">We will be in ​Wickson ​1017, Monday, talk ​at 1pm​, work​ ​session thereafter. ​If you can’t make it, join us live on <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/events/cfduavuth0kv42e9jqg2dh5kb98\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/events/cfduavuth0kv42e9jqg2dh5kb98&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317988000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17kKCmcuDmnxG4BkfWWF2D\">Google Hangout</a>, or it will be posted to <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0YC3NpDKMIg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3D0YC3NpDKMIg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317988000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1F5UsgqUYmFxxVdcZETW_o\">youtube</a> and our website after. See you Monday,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Michael​</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Michael Levy</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">PhD Candidate<br>Department of Environmental Science and Policy<br>University of California, Davis<br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mal...@ucdavis.edu</a><br><a href=\"http://www.michaellevy.name/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.michaellevy.name/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317988000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ItrQfkc63pqrKuAivLjmz\">www.michaellevy.name</a></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNh\r\nbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij5IaSBhbGwsPC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21h\r\naWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQt\r\nc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9\r\nImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij5OZXh0\r\nIHdlZWssIE5pc3RhcmEgUmFuZGhhd2Egd2lsbCBnaXZlIGEgdGFsayBvbiBhdXRob3JpbmcgYW5k\r\nIGRvY3VtZW50aW5nIHBhY2thZ2VzLiBJdCBzaG91bGQgYmUgZ3JlYXQ6PC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFz\r\ncz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7\r\nIGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIg\r\nc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7\r\nIj4mZ3Q7IExlYXJuIGhvdyB0byB3cml0ZSBhbmQgZG9jdW1lbnQgeW91ciBvd24gcGFja2FnZXMg\r\ndXNpbmcgZGV2dG9vbHMgYW5kIGdpdGh1Yi4gWW91J2xsIG5lZWQgZ2l0IGFuZCByc3R1ZGlvIGlu\r\nc3RhbGxlZCBvbiB5b3VyIGxhcHRvcHMgKHRoZSBwcmVyZXF1aXNpdGVzIGxpc3RlZCBvbiBodHRw\r\nOi8vc3RhdDU0NS5jb20vZ2l0MDdfZ2l0LWdpdGh1Yi1yc3R1ZGlvLmh0bWwgYXJlIHVzZWZ1bCBm\r\nb3IgdGhpcyksIGFzIHdlbGwgYXMgdGhlICdkZXZ0b29scycgbGlicmFyeS48L2Rpdj48ZGl2IGNs\r\nYXNzPSJnbWFpbF9kZWZhdWx0IiBzdHlsZT0iZm9udC1mYW1pbHk6IHRhaG9tYSwgc2Fucy1zZXJp\r\nZjsgZm9udC1zaXplOiBzbWFsbDsiPjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2IGNsYXNzPSJnbWFpbF9kZWZhdWx0\r\nIiBzdHlsZT0iZm9udC1mYW1pbHk6IHRhaG9tYSwgc2Fucy1zZXJpZjsgZm9udC1zaXplOiBzbWFs\r\nbDsiPjxkaXYgY2xhc3M9ImdtYWlsX2RlZmF1bHQiPldlIH