     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi all -- quick reminder that Nistara&#39;s talk is this afternoon at 1. See you there,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br>Michael</div></div>"
    ],
