   "subject": "Re: Talk next week: Writing your own packages",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The sound died out about 5 minutes into the talk, so here&#39;s the material I prepared for it: <a href=\"http://nistara.github.io/2016/05/01/building-R-package.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://nistara.github.io/2016/05/01/building-R-package.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2PpQ9b8AqnQ4Q7QcvViZJi\">http://nistara.github.io/2016/05/01/building-R-package.html</a></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Monday, May 2, 2016 at 8:52:22 AM UTC-7, Michael Levy wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi all -- quick reminder that Nistara&#39;s talk is this afternoon at 1. See you there,</div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br>Michael</div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Michael Levy</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">mal...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Apr 27, 2016 at 5:04 PM<br>Subject: Talk next week: Writing your own packages<br>To: <a rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a><br><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Next week, Nistara Randhawa will give a talk on authoring and documenting packages. It should be great:</p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:1.2em 0px;border-left-width:4px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(221,221,221);padding:0px 1em;color:rgb(119,119,119);quotes:none\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Learn how to write and document your own packages using devtools and github. You’ll need git and rstudio installed on your laptops (the prerequisites listed on <a href=\"http://stat545.com/git07_git-github-rstudio.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stat545.com/git07_git-github-rstudio.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ug6qSJAwuX-YZ3o4Ywhmv\">http://stat545.com/git07_git-github-rstudio.html</a> are useful for this), as well as the ‘devtools’ library.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">We will be in ​Wickson ​1017, Monday, talk ​at 1pm​, work​ ​session thereafter. ​If you can’t make it, join us live on <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/events/cfduavuth0kv42e9jqg2dh5kb98\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/events/cfduavuth0kv42e9jqg2dh5kb98&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cco3POC-owJEHc-xJ8n7n\">Google Hangout</a>, or it will be posted to <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0YC3NpDKMIg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3D0YC3NpDKMIg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ut04OmkZsX0N8xoBhtg_9\">youtube</a> and our website after. See you Monday,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Michael​</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Michael Levy</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">PhD Candidate<br>Department of Environmental Science and Policy<br>University of California, Davis<br><a rel=\"nofollow\">mal...@ucdavis.edu</a><br><a href=\"http://www.michaellevy.name/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.michaellevy.name/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467317994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tZcf1oxxIUEZwSiMRUjUg\">www.michaellevy.name</a></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNh\r\nbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij5IaSBhbGwsPC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21h\r\naWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQt\r\nc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9\r\nImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij5OZXh0\r\nIHdlZWssIE5pc3RhcmEgUmFuZGhhd2Egd2lsbCBnaXZlIGEgdGFsayBvbiBhdXRob3